{"id":"n83327-3-7","stage":3,"title":"상하 · 贵贱","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83327-3-7-1","ko":"요즘 세상에 상하 계층이 어딨어?","zh":"现在这世上哪还有上下阶层之分啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세상에","meaning":"世上，世间","explanation":"세상：世上，世间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"세상","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62441","senseId":"2","lemma":"세상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상하","meaning":"贵贱","explanation":"상하：贵贱","readings":[{"term":"상하","audio":"/audio/9beb99732f8092610926.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83327","senseId":"3","lemma":"상하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계층이","meaning":"阶层","explanation":"계층：阶层；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"계층","audio":"/audio/e65604ef146aa5ce221e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23285","senseId":"1","lemma":"계층","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어딨어?","meaning":"在哪里、哪有","explanation":"어딨다：在哪里、哪有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어딨다","audio":"/audio/75a66c2b7c76ba25ae9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:어딨다:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"어딨다","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"412ee72fe0ab7746","term":"세상","zh":"世上，世间","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3","entryId":"62441","definition":"人生活的整个社会。","pronunciation":["세ː상"]},{"id":"9beb99732f809261","term":"상하","zh":"贵贱","audio":"/audio/9beb99732f8092610926.mp3","entryId":"83327","definition":"身份的尊贵和低贱。","pronunciation":["상ː하"]},{"id":"e65604ef146aa5ce","term":"계층","zh":"阶层","audio":"/audio/e65604ef146aa5ce221e.mp3","entryId":"23285","definition":"在社会上根据地位、职业、经济水平等而划分的集团。","pronunciation":["계층","게층"]},{"id":"75a66c2b7c76ba25","term":"어딨다","zh":"在哪里、哪有","audio":"/audio/75a66c2b7c76ba25ae9d.mp3","definition":"어디 있다 的口语缩略；本句是“哪里还有”的反问。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/de7269468fdb7bc89884.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83327-3-7-2","ko":"그러게. 저 사람이 하는 얘기는 설득력이 없어.","zh":"就是啊。那个人说的话根本没说服力。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얘기는","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설득력이","meaning":"说服力","explanation":"설득력：说服力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"설득력","audio":"/audio/428d6766f60154c0fc32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62607","senseId":"1","lemma":"설득력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"谈话，说话","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"向某人诉说与某事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等有关的话。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"428d6766f60154c0","term":"설득력","zh":"说服力","audio":"/audio/428d6766f60154c0fc32.mp3","entryId":"62607","definition":"通过好好说明或劝导，能使对方听从或理解其话的一种能力。","pronunciation":["설뜽녁"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某个事实或现象在现实里不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d115ec691f39d0358fd3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.996,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83327","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":108,"sequenceScore":2.8227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["现在这世上哪还有上下阶层之分啊？","就是啊。那个人说的话根本没说服力。","承奎说好像能考上呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["现在这世上哪还有上下阶层之分啊？","就是啊。那个人说的话根本没说服力。","承奎说好像能考上呢？"],"answer":1}]}
